# AIWO (Aiwo Limited)

> AIWO is an Indian preventive-health and longevity company based in Chennai, Tamil Nadu. It provides diagnostic testing and health assessments, practitioner consultations, physiotherapy, aesthetics and body contouring, spa therapy, mental wellness, IV therapy, multi-day residential wellness programmes, and an online store offering AIWO-branded supplements, nutrition products and health foods.

AIWO describes itself as a wellness provider rather than a hospital, clinic, diagnostic centre, pharmacy or medical device. Information on the website is intended for wellness and informational purposes and should not replace professional medical advice.

