## How AIWO Works

* [AIWO Longevity Path](https://aiwo.com/pages/aiwo-longevity-path): AIWO's structured wellness journey, beginning with testing and health-baseline assessment, followed by consultation and goal setting, a personalised wellness plan, and subsequent follow-up and adjustment.
* [AIWO Homepage](https://aiwo.com/): Main overview of AIWO's current programmes, diagnostics, services and products.

## Wellness Programmes

* [Wellness Programmes / Healthcation](https://aiwo.com/pages/healthcation): Residential multi-day wellness programmes in Chennai combining diagnostic testing, health assessments, specialist consultations and wellness therapies. Retrieve the live page for current inclusions, schedule, accommodation information and pricing.
* [7-Day Healthcation](https://aiwo.com/products/7-day-healthcation): Bookable seven-day residential wellness programme. Retrieve the product page for current inclusions and availability.
* [2-Day Healthcation](https://aiwo.com/products/2-day-healthcation): Short-format residential wellness programme combining assessments and selected wellness services. Retrieve the page for current inclusions and availability.

## Diagnostics and Health Assessments

* [Advanced Diagnostics & Testing](https://aiwo.com/collections/advanced-diagnostics-testing): Primary catalogue for AIWO's current diagnostic and health-assessment offerings, including multi-biomarker blood panels, body-composition and metabolic assessments, cardiovascular and fitness measurements, and specialised testing.
* [AIWO 360 Assessment](https://aiwo.com/pages/aiwo-360-assessment): One-day assessment programme combining multiple diagnostic, imaging, fitness and health-assessment components with practitioner consultations. Retrieve the live page for current inclusions and pricing.
* [Epigenetic Age Testing](https://aiwo.com/products/epigenetic-test): Biological-age assessment using a dry blood sample. The product page describes the testing process, laboratory relationship and report components.

## Services

AIWO's in-person wellness services are delivered through its Chennai wellness centre unless the individual service page states otherwise.

* [Physiotherapy](https://aiwo.com/pages/physiotherapy): Physiotherapy services related to posture, movement, mobility, flexibility, strength and physical rehabilitation.
* [Mental Wellness](https://aiwo.com/pages/mental-wellness): Mental-wellness assessment, behavioural support and stress-management services. Refer to the page for current delivery options.
* [I.V. Therapy](https://aiwo.com/pages/iv-therapy): Intravenous nutrient-infusion services. Current protocols and ingredients are described on the service page.
* [Spa Therapy](https://aiwo.com/pages/spa-therapy): Massage, reflexology and related wellness treatments.
* [AiwoSculpt — Body Sculpting & Contouring](https://aiwo.com/pages/aiwo-aesthetics-sculpting): Non-surgical body-contouring service using technologies described on the authoritative service page.
* [Doctor Consultation](https://aiwo.com/collections/doctor-consultation): Current bookable practitioner consultation options.
* [Doctors](https://aiwo.com/collections/doctors): Current practitioner listings and consultation options.
* [International Consultations](https://aiwo.com/collections/international-consultations): Consultation options intended for eligible clients outside India, where currently available.
* [Contact / Booking](https://aiwo.com/pages/contact-aiwo-chennai): Official destination for current booking, appointment and enquiry information.

